  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.101 Utilized drug kit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.101 “Utilized drug kit” means the container approved by the MRH pharmacy for the storage of controlled drugs and whose container seal has been broken or whose seal is intact but with an expired expiration date identifier.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
